#### MV列表
#GET http://localhost:3471/mv/list
#
#### MV详情
#GET http://localhost:3471/mv/1
#
#### MV按风格筛选
#GET http://localhost:3471/mv/list?style= 流行
#
#### MV不存在（验证异常）
#GET http://localhost:3471/mv/999
#
#### 歌曲列表
#GET http://localhost:3471/song/list
### 登录拿token
POST http://localhost:3471/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wangwu",
  "password": "123456"
}
### 1. 不带token访问（预期401，验证拦截器）
GET http://localhost:3471/songList/list

### 2. 带token查看我的歌单（预期200，空数组）
GET http://localhost:3471/songList/list
token:eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODkyMTE1NzIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTI5Nzk3Mn0.hW5hE3Idw1AJvl_LDYttdklg8ebvL-ejE7pr2F9Mdig

### 3. 带token创建歌单
POST http://localhost:3471/songList/add
Content-Type: application/json
token:eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODkyMTE1NzIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTI5Nzk3Mn0.hW5hE3Idw1AJvl_LDYttdklg8ebvL-ejE7pr2F9Mdig

{
  "title": "我的最爱",
  "description": "喜欢的歌"
}

### 4. 再查我的歌单（应该有刚创建的）
GET http://localhost:3471/songList/list
token:eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODkyMTE1NzIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTI5Nzk3Mn0.hW5hE3Idw1AJvl_LDYttdklg8ebvL-ejE7pr2F9Mdig

### 5. 往歌单加歌（songListId 用第4步返回的id，songId用1）
POST http://localhost:3471/songList/addSong
Content-Type: application/json
token:eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODkyMTE1NzIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTI5Nzk3Mn0.hW5hE3Idw1AJvl_LDYttdklg8ebvL-ejE7pr2F9Mdig

{
  "songListId": 1,
  "songId": 1
}

### 6. 查看歌单里的歌曲（id 用歌单的id）
GET http://localhost:3471/songList/1/songs
token: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODkyMTE1NzIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTI5Nzk3Mn0.hW5hE3Idw1AJvl_LDYttdklg8ebvL-ejE7pr2F9Mdig"

### 7. 重复加同一首歌（预期报错"歌曲已在歌单中"）
POST http://localhost:3471/songList/addSong
Content-Type: application/json
token:eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIzIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ3YW5nd3UiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODkyMTE1NzIsImV4cCI6MTc4OTI5Nzk3Mn0.hW5hE3Idw1AJvl_LDYttdklg8ebvL-ejE7pr2F9Mdig

{
  "songListId": 1,
  "songId": 1
}